      "headers": [
        "You already know",
        "Stability framing"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Char. polynomial roots of `x'' + cx' + kx = 0`",
          "Eigenvalues of the companion Jacobian; `Re < 0` ⇔ damping `c > 0`"
        ],
        [
          "Routh–Hurwitz / pole locations (`control-theory/01`)",
          "Identical criterion: closed-loop poles = eigenvalues; LHP ⇔ stable"
        ],
        [
          "`e^{At}` matrix exponential",
          "The linearized flow *is* `e^{Jt}`; eigenvalues are its decay rates"
        ],
        [
          "Spectral radius `ρ(A) < 1` for a stable map",
          "The **discrete** analogue: `|λ| < 1` (inside unit circle) — Ch. 08"
        ],
        [
          "Gershgorin disks bounding eigenvalues",
          "A quick stability screen without solving the characteristic polynomial"
        ]
      ]
